# Camera System (Three.js)

## Camera Types

| Type | Three.js Class | Use Case |
|------|----------------|----------|
| Perspective | `PerspectiveCamera` | Standard 3D games |
| Orthographic | `OrthographicCamera` | 2D, isometric, UI |

## Basic Setup

